## 🗄️ 4. DATABASE MODELS & RELATIONSHIPS

### 📋 MongoDB Collections

#### **User Model**
```javascript
// Collection: users
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  name: String,
  email: String (unique),
  password: String (hashed),
  role: String (enum: ['doctor', 'patient', 'admin']),
  
  // Common fields
  phone: String,
  gender: String,
  picture: String,
  
  // Patient-specific fields
  dateOfBirth: Date,
  medicalHistory: [Object],
  totalVisits: Number,
  lastVisitDate: Date,
  
  // Doctor-specific fields
  specialization: String,
  qualification: String,
  experience: Number,
  consultationFee: Number,
  medicalLicense: String,
  hospitalAffiliation: String,
  languages: [String],
  availability: [Object],
  bio: String,
  
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

#### **Appointment Model**
```javascript
// Collection: appointments
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  patientId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  doctorId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  date: Date,
  time: String,
  reason: String,
  status: String (enum: ['pending', 'approved', 'completed', 'missed']),
  paymentStatus: String (enum: ['pending', 'completed', 'failed']),
  rating: Number (1-5),
  review: String,
  soapNote: ObjectId (ref: 'SOAPNote'),
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

#### **SOAP Note Model**
```javascript
// Collection: soapnotes
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  appointmentId: ObjectId (ref: 'Appointment'),
  patientId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  doctorId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  
  // SOAP Components
  subjective: String (required),
  objective: String (required),
  assessment: String (required),
  plan: String (required),
  
  // Follow-up Information
  followUp: {
    date: Date,
    notes: String,
    type: String (enum: ['in_person', 'telemedicine', 'emergency'])
  },
  
  // Metadata
  status: String (enum: ['draft', 'completed', 'signed']),
  doctorSignature: {
    timestamp: Date,
    ipAddress: String
  },
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

#### **Report/Prescription Model**
```javascript
// Collection: reports
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  patientId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  doctorId: ObjectId (ref: 'User'),
  appointmentId: ObjectId (ref: 'Appointment'),
  title: String,
  fileUrl: String,
  
  // Medical Information
  subjective: String,
  objective: String,
  assessment: String,
  plan: String,
  
  createdAt: Date
}
```

### 🔗 Data Relationships
```
User (1) ←→ (Many) Appointments
   ↓
   └→ SOAP Notes (1 per appointment)
   ↓
   └→ Reports/Prescriptions (Many per patient)

Doctor (1) ←→ (Many) Appointments
   ↓
   └→ SOAP Notes (Created per appointment)
   ↓
   └→ Patient Histories (Accessible per patient)
```

