## 🔐 5. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY

### 🎫 JWT Token System
```javascript
// JWT Token Structure
{
  "id": "user_object_id",
  "email": "user_email", 
  "role": "user_role",  // doctor, patient, admin
  "iat": 1234567890,        // Issued at timestamp
  "exp": 1234567890         // Expiration timestamp
}

// Token Storage & Usage
localStorage.setItem("token", jwt_token);
localStorage.setItem("role", user_role);
localStorage.setItem("userName", user_name);
localStorage.setItem("userId", user_id);

// Token Validation in API Calls
const headers = { 
  Authorization: `Bearer ${localStorage.getItem("token")}` 
};
```

### 🛡️ Security Features
```javascript
// Password Security
- bcrypt hashing for password storage
- Minimum password length validation
- Secure password reset functionality

// API Security
- JWT token expiration (24 hours)
- Role-based access control
- CORS configuration
- Input sanitization and validation
- Rate limiting on sensitive endpoints

// Frontend Security
- Protected routes implementation
- Token verification on each request
- Automatic logout on token expiration
- Secure storage (localStorage)
- Input validation and sanitization
```

### 🎭 Role-Based Access Control
```javascript
// Access Control Matrix
Role         | Dashboard      | Appointments | SOAP Notes | Prescriptions | Users | Analytics
--------------|---------------|-------------|------------|--------------|-------|----------
Doctor        | ✓ Doctor      | ✓           | ✓            | ✗     | ✗
Patient       | ✓ Patient     | ✗           | ✓            | ✗     | ✗  
Admin         | ✓ Admin       | ✓           | ✓            | ✓     | ✓

// Implementation in Components
if (userRole === "doctor") {
  // Show doctor-specific features
} else if (userRole === "patient") {
  // Show patient-specific features  
} else if (userRole === "admin") {
  // Show admin-specific features
}
```

